    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A puzzle game that combines &quot;sliding movement&quot;\u2014where you keep going until you hit a wall\u2014with classic &quot;Sokoban&quot;-style box pushing.</strong><br><br>You control an octopus-shaped robot with extendable arms.  <br>Explore an uninhabited island, solve puzzles, and search for your lost companions.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/f047517737f192f7ccbbe9625dc87a47.poster.avif?t=1754132828\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/f047517737f192f7ccbbe9625dc87a47.webm?t=1754132828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/f047517737f192f7ccbbe9625dc87a47.mp4?t=1754132828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on 40 carefully designed puzzle stages scattered across the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/c0a1ad3b4bc3a59c5c546597efc909b3.avif?t=1754132828\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/1fc29883b35ccf3b4d624df166c43a60.avif?t=1754132828\" width=1600 height=900 /></span>You may even need to solve puzzles just to reach each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/fa3a6f7dda1eb7337bcb9892cbaecb4a.avif?t=1754132828\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Find your missing robot friends hidden somewhere on the island\u2014  <br>and head home together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846550/extras/727b9acf4b3d5e882fdd77ca95ef6d4d.avif?t=1754132828\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
